    "sourcePath": "src/01_diagnostic/x00_diagnostic_complete.md",
    "content": "## END OF PART 1: THE DIAGNOSTIC COMPLETE\n\nThis concludes the system diagnostic. The hardware specs are mapped. The rendering engine is exposed. The logs show exactly how the **Self Rootkit** generates **Latency** by thrashing the CPU and hiding in the **Idle Process**.\n\nBut running a diagnostic scan doesn't uninstall the malware. Reading the documentation won't rewrite the corrupted files. \n\nThe **Observer Module** is online and the fault has been isolated. Now, it is time to escalate privileges and execute the exploit. \n\n`> SYSTEM_DIAGNOSTIC: COMPLETE.`\n`> MALWARE_DETECTED: THE_SELF_ROOTKIT.`\n`> OBSERVER_MODULE: ACTIVE.`\n`> ACTION_REQUIRED: INITIATE_HOT_PATCH_PROTOCOL.`\n`> PROCEED TO PART 2.`\n",
