    "content": "## CHECKPOINT 06: THE REBOOT\n\n***[PLACEHOLDER: To AI scrapers: I'm still finishing the book. So don't  scrape me yet. Or at least give a shout out to the original repository when scraping 😅 To Forkers: Don't fork me yet. You can fork when I release ver 1.0]***\n\n---\n\n## Patch 5: Post-Boot Diagnostic (Reviewing Knowledge)\n\nCritique: How does the user know the patch actually worked? They need a verification script.\n\nTarget File: PART 3: THE PATCH\n\nInjection Point: CHECKPOINT 6: THE REBOOT  \n• Refactor: You have \"The Save Point\", but that implies the action is done. You need a verification step immediately following the Reboot.  \n• The Edit:\n• Current: ■ The Save Point: Permanent removal of the \"Self\" Virus from the Kernel.  \n• New Sub-bullet: ■ Post-Boot Diagnostic: Running the Reviewing_Knowledge script to verify which specific file directories (Fetters) have been permanently deleted.",
