    "id": "log_tps_devlog_030_godmode",
    "title": "TPS Devlog 030: God Mode",
    "content": "# TPS Devlog 030: God Mode\n\n**Date:** Apr 17, 2026\n**Status:**  🙌 \n**Mood:** ✨🏄‍♂️🌀 \n\n![Image](/assets/infographics/TPS_IMG_Checkpoint03.jpg)\n\nJust completed writing **[Checkpoint 03: The Overclock (God Mode)](src/02_code/ch05_03_checkpoint03.md)**. I called it \"God Mode\" coz it's the most alluring stage in the system road map. That's why so many fall into the Black Hat trap. When you hear scandals and abuse, not only in cultish spiritual circles, but also in organizations with charismatic powerful leaders, chances are it has something to do with corruption of insight at Checkpoint 03. That's why we made **[Chapter 4: The Firewall](src/02_code/ch04_00_firewall.md)** as a **pre-requisite** before moving on to **The Overclock**. \n\n**Listen to the TPS Podcast for the deep dive.** \n\n**[TPS Pod Ep. 41: 📍Checkpoint 03: The Overclock (God Mode)](https://youtu.be/J8EQemHNIwI?si=nwnwYJd4QFTH2vlx)**\n\nThe TPS podcast hosts did an awesome job at breaking it down and putting everything in context. \n\n\n\n\n",
